    [&quot;01  建立阵容&quot;]=&quot;01  Draft your team&quot;,[&quot;02  争夺先攻&quot;]=&quot;02  Seize initiative&quot;,[&quot;03  承诺行动&quot;]=&quot;03  Commit your action&quot;,[&quot;01 / 建立阵容&quot;]=&quot;01 / Team draft&quot;,[&quot;02 / 隐藏命线&quot;]=&quot;02 / Secret lifeline&quot;,[&quot;03 / 争夺先攻&quot;]=&quot;03 / Initiative&quot;,[&quot;04 / 技能窗口&quot;]=&quot;04 / Ability phase&quot;,[&quot;05 / 承诺进攻&quot;]=&quot;05 / Commit attack&quot;,[&quot;06 / 预判格挡&quot;]=&quot;06 / Predict the block&quot;,[&quot;07 / 亡语续算&quot;]=&quot;07 / Resolve deathrattles&quot;,
    [&quot;蛇形选取五名不同单位，保留角色各自的反制能力。&quot;]=&quot;Draft five different units. Keep their strengths and counters in mind.&quot;,[&quot;蛇形选人：首选方先选 1 名，之后双方轮流选 2 名，最后另一方选 1 名。&quot;]=&quot;Snake draft: the first side picks one unit, then sides alternate picking two. The other side takes the final pick.&quot;,[&quot;点选单位查看能力，再确认入队。双方各选五名，不可重复选择。&quot;]=&quot;Inspect a unit, then confirm your pick. Each side drafts five units; no unit can be picked twice.&quot;,[&quot;观察对手已选阵容，准备你的下一手。&quot;]=&quot;Read the opposing draft and prepare your next pick.&quot;,[&quot;先点单位查看能力，再确认入队。当前还可选 &quot;]=&quot;Inspect a unit before confirming. Picks remaining: &quot;,[&quot; 名；双方不能重复选择同一单位。&quot;]=&quot;. Units cannot be shared between teams.&quot;,
    [&quot;选择一名己方其他单位，再选择敌方单位。己方目标阵亡时，敌方目标随之阵亡。只有你知道命线。&quot;]=&quot;Choose one other ally, then one enemy. If the linked ally dies, the linked enemy dies too. Your lifeline remains secret.&quot;,[&quot;先选己方其他单位，再选敌方单位。己方绑定单位阵亡时，敌方绑定单位也会阵亡。&quot;]=&quot;Choose one other ally, then one enemy. When the linked ally dies, the linked enemy also dies.&quot;,[&quot;命线触发条件是绑定单位阵亡；不是每次受伤。&quot;]=&quot;Lifeline triggers when the linked ally dies, not whenever it takes damage.&quot;,[&quot;对手正在布置命线。它的目标尚未揭示。&quot;]=&quot;Your opponent is setting a lifeline. Its targets are hidden.&quot;,[&quot;对手正在布置命线。敌方绑定目标不会向你揭示。&quot;]=&quot;Your opponent is setting a secret lifeline. You cannot see its targets.&quot;,
    [&quot;秩序 &gt; 新月 &gt; 荒芜 &gt; 秩序。相同能核重新暗选。&quot;]=&quot;Order &gt; Crescent &gt; Wastes &gt; Order. Matching cores force a new secret choice.&quot;,[&quot;秩序克新月，新月克荒芜，荒芜克秩序。锁定前只能看到自己的选择。&quot;]=&quot;Order defeats Crescent, Crescent defeats Wastes, and Wastes defeats Order. Both choices remain hidden until locked.&quot;,[&quot;箭头表示克制。相同能核重新暗选，后攻方仍有一次行动。&quot;]=&quot;Arrows show which core wins. Matching cores are chosen again. The second side still gets one action.&quot;,[&quot;同核会重新暗选。后攻方仍有一次行动，先攻不等于多一次攻击。&quot;]=&quot;Matching cores force a new choice. Initiative changes the order; it does not grant an extra attack.&quot;,[&quot;能核决定行动顺序。技能先于普攻结算；防守方只能让一名单位保护自己。仅剩一名单位时无法格挡。&quot;]=&quot;Cores decide who acts first. Abilities resolve before basic attacks. The defender can protect one unit; a lone survivor cannot block.&quot;,
    [&quot;技能与普攻分开：可先使用当前可用的技能，也可直接进入攻击阶段。&quot;]=&quot;Abilities and basic attacks are separate decisions. Use an available ability first, or move straight to the attack phase.&quot;,[&quot;技能消耗冷却或限定次数。选中攻击目标后，等待对方暗选格挡。&quot;]=&quot;Abilities use a cooldown or a once-per-match charge. Commit your attack, then wait for the defender's secret block.&quot;,[&quot;攻击技能有独立开关。普通攻击不会自动消耗攻击技能的冷却。&quot;]=&quot;Attack abilities must be enabled explicitly. A normal attack does not use an attack ability's cooldown.&quot;,[&quot;可选择己方单位查看技能，也可直接进入攻击。技能效果会说明是否需要目标。&quot;]=&quot;Inspect an ally's ability or proceed directly to attack. Ability descriptions explain their target requirements.&quot;,[&quot;对手在使用技能。先观察已经揭示的效果，再准备格挡。&quot;]=&quot;Your opponent is using abilities. Observe the revealed effects and prepare to block.&quot;,[&quot;对手处于技能窗口。生命与冷却是已知信息。&quot;]=&quot;Your opponent is in the ability phase. HP and cooldowns are public information.&quot;,
    [&quot;选择进攻单位与目标；对手随后暗选格挡。&quot;]=&quot;Choose your attacker and target. Your opponent then secretly chooses a unit to protect.&quot;,[&quot;先选己方进攻单位，再选敌方目标。承诺后，对手会暗选格挡，随后才揭示攻击。&quot;]=&quot;Choose an allied attacker, then an enemy target. Commit your attack; it is revealed after the defender chooses a block.&quot;,[&quot;对手正在选择攻击；它的单位与目标尚未揭示。&quot;]=&quot;Your opponent is choosing an attack. The attacker and target are still hidden.&quot;,[&quot;你的攻击已承诺。等待对手暗选格挡后一起揭示。&quot;]=&quot;Attack committed. Both choices are revealed after your opponent locks a block.&quot;,[&quot;你已承诺进攻。等待对手选择格挡，随后揭示结算。&quot;]=&quot;Attack committed. Wait for the block, then watch the resolution.&quot;,
    [&quot;攻击已承诺，目标仍未知。让一名己方单位保护自己，或选择放弃格挡。&quot;]=&quot;An attack is committed, but its target is hidden. Choose one ally to protect itself, or pass.&quot;,[&quot;敌方攻击已经承诺，目标仍未知。选择一名己方单位，让它保护自己。低语的攻击无法格挡。&quot;]=&quot;The attack target is hidden. Choose one allied unit to protect itself. Whisper's attack cannot be blocked.&quot;,[&quot;格挡只保护所选单位；低语普攻无法格挡。防守方仅剩一名单位时，跳过格挡阶段。&quot;]=&quot;A block protects only the selected unit. Whisper bypasses blocking. The block phase is skipped for a lone survivor.&quot;,[&quot;格挡不会替队友承伤。选择哪一名，就保护哪一名。&quot;]=&quot;Blocking protects the selected unit only. It does not redirect damage from a teammate.&quot;,
    [&quot;残影已经阵亡，但亡语尚未结算。选择一名存活敌方单位，造成 15 点不可格挡直伤。&quot;]=&quot;Echo is dead, but its deathrattle is pending. Choose a living enemy to take 15 unblockable direct damage.&quot;,[&quot;残影的亡语正在选目标。剩余结算会在选择后继续。&quot;]=&quot;Echo's deathrattle needs a target. The remaining resolution continues after the choice.&quot;,[&quot;对手正在选择亡语目标。选择后会继续尚未结束的结算。&quot;]=&quot;Your opponent is choosing a deathrattle target. The remaining resolution follows.&quot;,[&quot;亡语不可格挡。剩余攻击、命线与连锁结算仍会继续，直到队列处理完毕。&quot;]=&quot;Deathrattles cannot be blocked. Remaining attacks, lifelines and death chains continue until every pending effect resolves.&quot;,
    [&quot;被动能力会自动触发。&quot;]=&quot;Passive abilities trigger automatically.&quot;,[&quot;被动能力自动触发，无需手动释放。&quot;]=&quot;This passive triggers automatically. No manual activation is needed.&quot;,[&quot;该单位的技能窗口被封锁；普通攻击仍可选择它。&quot;]=&quot;This unit's ability is locked. It may still make a basic attack.&quot;,[&quot;该技能在攻击阶段启用。先进入攻击，再选择是否使用。&quot;]=&quot;Enable this ability during the attack phase, before committing.&quot;,[&quot;该能力在攻击阶段启用。&quot;]=&quot;This ability is enabled during the attack phase.&quot;,[&quot;技能窗口被封锁，仍可进入攻击。&quot;]=&quot;Abilities are locked. You can still proceed to attack.&quot;,[&quot;技能生效后继续进入攻击阶段。&quot;]=&quot;Resolve the ability, then proceed to attack.&quot;,[&quot;看清技能的触发阶段、冷却或限定次数，再决定是否使用。&quot;]=&quot;Check the ability's phase, cooldown and charges before using it.&quot;,
    [&quot;当前为普通攻击；技能尚未启用。&quot;]=&quot;Normal attack selected. Attack ability is off.&quot;,[&quot;裂轨射击需要两个不同目标。&quot;]=&quot;Split Rail requires two different targets.&quot;,[&quot;双轨攻击两名不同敌人，对方只能保护其中一名。仅剩一名敌人时不能启用。&quot;]=&quot;Twinrail attacks two different enemies. Only one can be protected. Split Rail is unavailable against a lone enemy.&quot;,[&quot;敌方只剩一名单位，裂轨射击需要两个不同目标；本次使用普攻。&quot;]=&quot;Only one enemy remains. Split Rail needs two targets; use a normal attack instead.&quot;,[&quot;重锤可双击同一目标：再次点①即可标为①②；也可选另一个目标。&quot;]=&quot;Maul can strike the same target twice: select target ① again for ①②, or select a different enemy.&quot;,[&quot;先选①目标，再选不同的②目标。①被击杀后才会续算②；仅剩一个敌人时不需②。&quot;]=&quot;Choose target ①, then a different target ②. The second strike happens only if the first kills. No second target is needed against a lone enemy.&quot;,[&quot;点击第二目标；再次点击同一目标可连击。&quot;]=&quot;Choose a second target, or select the same target again to strike it twice.&quot;,
    [&quot;限定技本局已经用完。&quot;]=&quot;This ability has already been used this match.&quot;,[&quot;限定技已耗尽&quot;]=&quot;No charges left&quot;,[&quot;限定技已使用&quot;]=&quot;Used this match&quot;,[&quot;的限定技已耗尽，本局不能再次使用。&quot;]=&quot; has no charges left this match.&quot;,[&quot;技能冷却剩余 &quot;]=&quot;Ability ready in &quot;,[&quot;还需冷却 &quot;]=&quot;Ready in &quot;,[&quot; 回合；每完整回合结束后递减。&quot;]=&quot; rounds; reduced after each complete round.&quot;,[&quot; 回合。&quot;]=&quot; rounds.&quot;,[&quot;代价：技能攻击后冷却 &quot;]=&quot;After the attack: cooldown &quot;,[&quot;代价：使用后冷却 &quot;]=&quot;Cooldown after use: &quot;,[&quot;代价：限定技本局只能使用一次。&quot;]=&quot;Once per match.&quot;,[&quot;代价：残影立即阵亡，再手动选择亡语目标。&quot;]=&quot;Echo dies immediately. Then choose a deathrattle target.&quot;,[&quot;自毁会让残影立即阵亡并触发亡语；这不是普通伤害技能。&quot;]=&quot;Self-destruct kills Echo immediately and triggers its deathrattle.&quot;,[&quot;无需敌方目标：恢复所有己方存活单位。&quot;]=&quot;No enemy target required. Heal every living ally.&quot;,[&quot;无需敌方目标：自毁后再选择亡语目标。&quot;]=&quot;No target needed yet. Self-destruct, then choose the deathrattle target.&quot;,[&quot;先选择技能目标；双目标技能还需选择②。&quot;]=&quot;Choose the ability target. Two-target abilities also need target ②.&quot;,
