    [&quot;选择一种能核&quot;]=&quot;Choose a core&quot;,[&quot;选择进攻单位&quot;]=&quot;Choose attacker&quot;,[&quot;选择攻击目标&quot;]=&quot;Choose attack target&quot;,[&quot;选择①目标&quot;]=&quot;Choose target ①&quot;,[&quot;选择②目标&quot;]=&quot;Choose target ②&quot;,[&quot;选择第二目标&quot;]=&quot;Choose second target&quot;,[&quot;选择亡语目标&quot;]=&quot;Choose deathrattle target&quot;,[&quot;选择己方单位，查看技能&quot;]=&quot;Inspect an allied ability&quot;,[&quot;选择己方单位（不能是缚命）&quot;]=&quot;Choose an ally other than Tether&quot;,[&quot;选择敌方绑定目标&quot;]=&quot;Choose the linked enemy&quot;,[&quot;选择一名己方格挡单位&quot;]=&quot;Choose an ally to protect&quot;,[&quot;选择要保护的己方单位。&quot;]=&quot;Choose the allied unit to protect.&quot;,[&quot;先选进攻单位&quot;]=&quot;Choose an attacker first&quot;,[&quot;先选格挡单位&quot;]=&quot;Choose a blocking unit first&quot;,[&quot;先选一名单位&quot;]=&quot;Choose a unit first&quot;,[&quot;先选择&quot;]=&quot;Choose &quot;,[&quot;目标已选择&quot;]=&quot;Target selected&quot;,[&quot;目标：&quot;]=&quot;Target: &quot;,[&quot;目标&quot;]=&quot;Target&quot;,[&quot;无需目标&quot;]=&quot;No target&quot;,[&quot;已启用&quot;]=&quot;Enabled&quot;,[&quot;未启用&quot;]=&quot;Off&quot;,[&quot;已耗尽&quot;]=&quot;Used&quot;,[&quot;未选择&quot;]=&quot;Not selected&quot;,[&quot;被封锁&quot;]=&quot; Locked&quot;,[&quot; 已封锁&quot;]=&quot; Locked&quot;,[&quot;已锁定，等待揭示&quot;]=&quot;Locked · Waiting for reveal&quot;,[&quot;已锁定 · 等待揭示&quot;]=&quot;Locked · Waiting for reveal&quot;,[&quot;锁定后等待双方揭示&quot;]=&quot;Lock your choice, then reveal together&quot;,
    [&quot;己方已入队 &quot;]=&quot;Your picks &quot;,[&quot;己方已选&quot;]=&quot;Your draft&quot;,[&quot;对手已选&quot;]=&quot;Opponent's draft&quot;,[&quot;对手正在选人。观察它的阵容，准备下一次选择。&quot;]=&quot;Your opponent is drafting. Read their team and prepare your next pick.&quot;,[&quot;对手正在行动。留意生命和冷却变化。&quot;]=&quot;Your opponent is acting. Watch HP and cooldowns.&quot;,[&quot;等待对手结束行动。&quot;]=&quot;Wait for your opponent to finish.&quot;,[&quot;未知&quot;]=&quot;Unknown&quot;,[&quot;未揭示&quot;]=&quot;Hidden&quot;,[&quot;尚未揭示&quot;]=&quot;Hidden&quot;,[&quot;已揭示&quot;]=&quot;Revealed&quot;,[&quot;观察对手&quot;]=&quot;Read the opponent&quot;,[&quot;记住这一点&quot;]=&quot;Remember this&quot;,[&quot;看清&quot;]=&quot;Inspect&quot;,
    [&quot;训练完成&quot;]=&quot;Training complete&quot;,[&quot;训练 &quot;]=&quot;Training &quot;,[&quot;战术指导  &quot;]=&quot;Battle guide  &quot;,[&quot;练习技能&quot;]=&quot;Practice an ability&quot;,[&quot;恢复哨卫&quot;]=&quot;Heal Warden&quot;,[&quot;保护支援单位&quot;]=&quot;Protect your support&quot;,[&quot;查看一名单位的能力&quot;]=&quot;Inspect a unit's ability&quot;,[&quot;再试一次&quot;]=&quot;Try again&quot;,[&quot;这一步先选择&quot;]=&quot;For this step, choose &quot;,[&quot;这一步需要先选择复苏，释放修复脉冲。&quot;]=&quot;Choose Mender, then use Repair Pulse.&quot;,[&quot;先观察角色用途。复苏负责恢复，是这次教学场景要保护的支援单位。&quot;]=&quot;Inspect the units first. Mender heals your team and is the support to protect in this lesson.&quot;,[&quot;教学对手倾向攻击支援单位。复苏负责恢复；点选它，再确认格挡。哨卫已在前一回合受伤，稍后将练习恢复。&quot;]=&quot;The training opponent favors attacking your support. Select Mender and lock the block. Warden was wounded last round; you will heal him next.&quot;,[&quot;格挡只保护你选中的那名单位，不会替队友承伤。观察教学提示，再试一次。&quot;]=&quot;A block protects only the selected unit. It does not take a teammate's damage. Read the hint and try again.&quot;,[&quot;你让复苏保护自己，正好挡住了双轨的攻击。接下来练习恢复受伤的哨卫。&quot;]=&quot;Mender protected herself and blocked Twinrail's attack. Next, heal the wounded Warden.&quot;,[&quot;格挡成功不造成伤害。接下来恢复前一回合受伤的哨卫。&quot;]=&quot;A successful block prevents damage. Next, heal Warden's wound from the previous round.&quot;,[&quot;哨卫现在为 23 / 26 生命。选择复苏，再释放修复脉冲，恢复所有受伤的己方单位。使用技能后仍有一次普攻。&quot;]=&quot;Warden has 23 / 26 HP. Select Mender and use Repair Pulse to heal wounded allies. You still get a basic attack afterward.&quot;,[&quot;释放后进入冷却，但不会消耗普攻机会。选择复苏，观察哨卫的生命恢复。&quot;]=&quot;Using an ability starts its cooldown but does not spend your basic attack. Choose Mender and watch Warden recover.&quot;,[&quot;选择复苏，恢复己方受伤单位，无需敌方目标。&quot;]=&quot;Choose Mender to heal wounded allies. No enemy target is needed.&quot;,[&quot;哨卫已恢复至 26 / 26，复苏进入 3 回合冷却。进入攻击阶段，选择进攻单位和目标。可试选夺魄，再启用掠魂；不启用则是普通攻击。教学对手会格挡荒行，选择其他目标观察命中。&quot;]=&quot;Warden is back to 26 / 26 HP; Mender starts a 3-round cooldown. Choose an attacker and target. Try Reaper with Soul Reap enabled, or leave it off for a normal attack. The training opponent will protect Outrider.&quot;,[&quot;选择进攻单位与目标。可启用掠魂；普通攻击不会自动使用技能。教学对手会格挡荒行。&quot;]=&quot;Choose an attacker and target. Soul Reap must be enabled separately. The training opponent will block Outrider.&quot;,[&quot;先进入攻击阶段，再选择进攻单位。攻击技能需要独立启用；普攻不会自动消耗它。&quot;]=&quot;Enter the attack phase, then choose your attacker. Attack abilities must be enabled separately.&quot;,[&quot;你保护了复苏、用技能恢复了哨卫，并完成进攻承诺。技能窗口与普攻是两次不同的决策；攻击技能还要独立启用。正式对局不公开对手意图，训练不计比赛战绩。&quot;]=&quot;You protected Mender, healed Warden and committed an attack. Abilities and basic attacks are separate decisions. Attack abilities must also be enabled explicitly. In a real match, the opponent's intent stays hidden.&quot;,[&quot;正式对手不会公开它准备攻击谁。训练提示不会出现在正式对局中。&quot;]=&quot;Outside training, your opponent's intended target stays hidden.&quot;,[&quot;，练习恢复技能。&quot;]=&quot; to practice healing.&quot;,[&quot;消灭对方全部单位&quot;]=&quot;Eliminate every opposing unit&quot;,[&quot;让对手先露出破绽&quot;]=&quot;Make your opponent reveal an opening&quot;,
    [&quot;对局日志&quot;]=&quot;Battle log&quot;,[&quot;展开对局日志&quot;]=&quot;Open battle log&quot;,[&quot;收起日志&quot;]=&quot;Close log&quot;,[&quot;日志&quot;]=&quot;Log&quot;,[&quot;BATTLE LOG / 对局日志&quot;]=&quot;BATTLE LOG&quot;,[&quot;FIELD GUIDE / 作战指导&quot;]=&quot;FIELD GUIDE&quot;,[&quot;HEAD TO HEAD / 双人对峙&quot;]=&quot;HEAD TO HEAD&quot;,[&quot;UNIT POOL / 单位池&quot;]=&quot;UNIT POOL&quot;,[&quot;OPPONENT / 对手阵容&quot;]=&quot;OPPONENT&quot;,[&quot;YOUR FORMATION / 你的阵容&quot;]=&quot;YOUR FORMATION&quot;,[&quot;REVEALED / 已揭示&quot;]=&quot;REVEALED&quot;,[&quot;KNOWN  /  已知\n阵容、生命与技能冷却\n\nUNKNOWN  /  未知\n未揭示的能核、攻击意图与敌方命线&quot;]=&quot;KNOWN\nTeams, HP and ability cooldowns\n\nHIDDEN\nUnrevealed cores, attacks and opposing lifelines&quot;,
