    [&quot;核心玩法来源\n《核域对峙 / 异象迷宫》Web 原型\n\n场景与界面\n本工程原创几何、排版与镜头\n\n音效\nRoblox 内置采样；AgentAST / Sci-fi Interface GUI\n剪辑、调速、淡出与混音。\n&quot;]=&quot;Gameplay foundation\nLegacy web prototype\n\nScene &amp; interface\nOriginal geometry, typography and cameras\n\nAudio\nRoblox assets; Pro Sound Effects; AgentAST\nEditing, playback shaping and mixing.\n&quot;,
